// Term dispatcher: SIRTerm kind -> emit (const/var/call/prims/case/let). Mutual-recursion core.
//
// Pools signature discipline:
// - Full pools (all literal/int tables) only on entrypoints and SCC helpers that call
//   term_to_asm_opt_bound / emit_generic_user_call_asm_inner (or recurse among themselves).
// - Leaf kind paths use term_emit_const / term_emit_var / term_case_patterns with narrow pools.
// - Do not add new full-pools helpers that only forward; extend an existing SCC entry instead.
// - File-split only after back-edges are removed (one-way helpers only).
// - Kind let/compound (+ flats) live in term_emit_kind_* with open recursion
//   (emit_child fn param) so they are not in term_emitter's static SCC.
// - Packaging: kind APIs take bound (+ atom table where needed), not full pools.
//   emit_child = fn(Term, string, Bound) -> string with pools captured via make_term_emit_child.


